    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_RaEmulatorLogTracking_Help">RetroAchievements のウェブサイトを定期確認する代わりに、エミュレータのログファイルから実績の解除を即座に検知します。エミュレータ側でログのファイル出力を有効にしてください。ログが自動検出されない場合のみ、以下でパスのオーバーライドを設定してください。</sys:String>

    <!-- Provider: Guild Wars 2 -->
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_GW2_Help">Guild Wars 2 achievements are read from ArenaNet's official API, which needs a free API key tied to your Guild Wars 2 account:</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_GW2_SetupStep2">2. Create a new key and tick progression. That is the only permission this plugin needs, and a key limited to it cannot read your wallet, inventory or trading post history.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_GW2_SetupStep3">3. Copy the key into the box below, then click Check.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_GW2_NoDatesNote">Guild Wars 2 では実績の獲得日時が記録されず、達成率も公開されてないため、Guild Wars 2 の実績には解除日とレア度が表示されません。</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_GW2_ApiKey_Help">The key is stored in the plugin settings in readable form and sent only to api.guildwars2.com. It can only read, and you can delete it at any time on the page where you created it.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_GW2_MissingProgression">The key is valid but lacks the progression permission. Create a new key with progression ticked.</sys:String>

    <!-- Provider: Hypixel -->
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_Hypixel_NoDatesNote">Achievements are read from your public Hypixel profile. Hypixel does not record when an achievement was earned, so Hypixel achievements show no unlock date.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_Hypixel_PlayerNotFound">No Hypixel player found with that username.</sys:String>
    <!-- Hypixel_Unavailable: leave the domain "hypixel.net" untranslated. -->
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_Hypixel_Unavailable">hypixel.net could not be reached to look up the player. Try again later.</sys:String>

    <!-- Provider: Minecraft -->
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_MinecraftGameFoldersHint">Add a launcher folder such as %AppData%\PrismLauncher to read all of its instances, or a single instance or .minecraft folder. Empty reads %AppData%\.minecraft.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_MinecraftPlayerUuid">プレイヤー UUID</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_MinecraftPlayerUuid_Help">Optional. Leave empty to use the accounts signed in to your launchers.</sys:String>

    <!-- Provider: Riot -->
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_Riot_Help">League of Legens チャレンジを取得するには Riot の公式 API を使用するため、Riot アカウントに紐づいた無料の API キーが必要です。Riot は API キーなしで動作するプレイヤー別のエンドポイントを提供していません:</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_Riot_SetupStep2">2. ダッシュボードに表示されている開発用 API キーを、下の API キー入力欄にコピーしてください。期限が切れている場合は再生成 (Regenerate) ボタンを使用してください。</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_Riot_SetupStep3">3. Enter your Riot ID and pick the region your account plays on, then click Check.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_Riot_Expiry">A development key stops working after 24 hours and has to be regenerated each time. For a key that does not expire, use Register Product on the portal to apply for a personal key.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_Riot_Note">Riot reviews personal and production applications separately; the {0} explains what to expect.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_RiotId">Riot ID</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_RiotId_Help">Your in-game name and tag, for example Faker and KR1. The tag is the part after the # on your profile.</sys:String>

    <!-- Provider: Steam -->
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_SteamInstallPathOverride">Steam インストールパスのオーバーライド</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_SteamInstallPathOverride_Help">Optional. Leave empty to detect Steam from the current-user registry. Used for instant in-game monitoring and local offline refreshes.</sys:String>
    <!-- Provider: RPCS3 -->
